{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02933",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 5.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right then, come on in. What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.45,
      "end_seconds": 15.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a growing red ring on my thigh, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.57,
      "end_seconds": 20.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.34,
      "end_seconds": 31.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "I'm on something called eltr... Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.53,
      "end_seconds": 37.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.06,
      "end_seconds": 40.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.15,
      "end_seconds": 62.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "How long has it been like this? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.3,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.09,
      "end_seconds": 76.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Yes. Alright, any aching muscles as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.34,
      "end_seconds": 82.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, about the same, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.72,
      "end_seconds": 93.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say. I had tiredness before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.27,
      "end_seconds": 97.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "What about facial weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.66,
      "end_seconds": 101.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "No, none, no facial weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.75,
      "end_seconds": 107.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Any palpitations, joint swelling or stiff neck at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.92,
      "end_seconds": 113.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "No, you know, no palpitations, joint swelling or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.47,
      "end_seconds": 119.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.45,
      "end_seconds": 122.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.71,
      "end_seconds": 138.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.11,
      "end_seconds": 149.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat for nearly five years now. I have an underactive thyroid, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.9,
      "end_seconds": 166.88,
      "duration_seconds": 13.98,
      "text": "Right, so an irregular heartbeat and an underactive thyroid are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.9,
      "end_seconds": 172.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'm allergic to trimethoprim, I get a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.29,
      "end_seconds": 177.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.38,
      "end_seconds": 187.16,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.43,
      "end_seconds": 206.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.38,
      "end_seconds": 219.59,
      "duration_seconds": 12.21,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days. I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.25,
      "end_seconds": 224.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.54,
      "end_seconds": 234.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.02,
      "end_seconds": 261.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.44,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 70 beats a minute, saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 18, BP is 108 over 80, temperature is 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.5,
      "end_seconds": 264.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.04,
      "end_seconds": 268.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.98,
      "end_seconds": 275.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.35,
      "end_seconds": 277.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.13,
      "end_seconds": 280.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.4,
      "end_seconds": 299.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "There is an expanding ring-shaped red patch, about eight centimetres across, on the thigh."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.48,
      "end_seconds": 335.34,
      "duration_seconds": 29.86,
      "text": "You can relax now. Having listened and examined, it fits best with early Lyme disease. I'm prescribing doxycycline, 100 milligrams, twice a day, twenty-one days. It's for early Lyme disease. Take the doxycycline with food and avoid strong sun. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.28,
      "end_seconds": 343.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "I'd like you back in three weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.95,
      "end_seconds": 345.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.85,
      "end_seconds": 348.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}